5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's get this sorted! I want to know exactly what we're dealing with. I'll check the ledger and the bank statements.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree we need clarity. I'm interested in the weekday turnout and the winter social feedback.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm looking at the sign-in sheets and the rota. We need to see who's actually doing the work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
