30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Most of our costs are fixed, like hall hire. Also, some people really struggle to pay the whole fee at once.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,It seems people are hesitant. Charging for outings actually drove some regulars away from the weekday meetings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"It's worse than I thought. A tiny group does everything, while some members never even show up.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer is spending way too much time chasing small payments. Mid-year calculations are a nightmare too.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Taster guests hate the idea of a full year's commitment, and old tiered systems caused a lot of friction.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if chasing money is the problem, maybe we should simplify how we collect it?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, but we can't just ignore that people feel uneasy about the cost of attending.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, the people who attend the most are the ones carrying the club. It's not fair.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, regardless of fairness, the administrative burden is unsustainable for the treasurer.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, but if we make it too rigid, we'll lose the newcomers who just want to drift in.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,"We need a balance. We can't guess the numbers, but we can't make it a chore for the treasurer.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I worry that any ""per event"" charge will make people weigh up every single visit.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Takumi,,Then we need a system where those who use the club more pay their fair share.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"A single annual payment is the most efficient for the books, but Mio mentioned payment struggles.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"And the tiered system Kenji mentioned—wait, I mean the minutes—showed it creates a social divide.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Mio,,Let's look at the options when they come. We need something stable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I just want the atmosphere to feel welcoming again.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I want the workload and the cost to be equitable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I want a system that doesn't burn out the next treasurer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I want it to stay open and friendly for everyone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,3,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
51,3,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
