54,3,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
55,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Okay, we have a Flat Fee, Tiered Membership, or Activity-Based Charging. A flat fee is simple but hard for some to pay.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Activity-based charging sounds like it would increase the hesitancy I saw in the turnout records.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Tiered membership could address the imbalance, but Kenji said it caused friction in the past.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Activity-based is a disaster for the treasurer. Six hours a month chasing money is too much.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"I agree. Tiered levels make people feel like ""lower grade"" members. That's not good.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,"If we go with a Flat Fee, can we allow people to spread the payments? That would help the bank issues.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"A Flat Fee makes the evenings ""already theirs,"" which is what we need to bring people back.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Takumi,,But the people who never show up still get the same benefit? That's the problem.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the administrative cost of tracking every single visit outweighs the ""fairness"" of the fee.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"A Flat Fee is the most invisible. Nobody has to worry about their ""grade"" or a coin purse.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,I think the Flat Fee is the safest bet for the budget since most costs are fixed anyway.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I strongly support the Flat Fee. It removes the barrier to entry for each meeting.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm still not happy about the ghosts, but I see the treasurer's point.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Toshio,,The Flat Fee is the only one that doesn't create a bookkeeping nightmare.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"It's the most welcoming for newcomers, provided we are flexible with the payment date.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Mio,,It sounds like we're mostly in agreement.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I'm satisfied with that.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Takumi,,I'll concede for the sake of the treasurer.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
